fixes.react:
Implement responsive design using CSS-in-JS libraries like styled-components or emotion. Use media queries to adjust layout for smaller viewports. Example: 
const Container = styled.div`
  width: 100%;
  @media (max-width: 320px) {
    width: 100%;
  }
`;

